# Taris, the Upper City cantina's pazaak (K1, tar_m02ae): Garouk's deck
# bought and his lesson (the tutorial, no wager), then a match with Niklos
# for 40 credits, played out to his end script, which starts his
# conversation again with the result. A match is played as
# `sim::pazaak::Match::advice` says:
#   kjk playthrough k1 tar_m02ae data/routes/k1/taris_pazaak.route
gold 200                 # a stand-in for the credits a run brings here
say buy your deck        # Garouk: fifty credits for his deck...
say pazaak lesson        # ...and his free lesson
use Garouk021
talk
pazaak                   # the lesson (his end script asks for "Garouk21": none answers)
say let's play           # Niklos
use Niklos021
talk
pazaak                   # 40 credits on it
pick 4                   # Niklos again, won or lost: away
talk
